---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { readFileSync } from 'node:fs';
import path from 'node:path';

// For simplicity in this script, I'll just hardcode the migration of the terms content
// as it's usually static and doesn't change often.
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
        
        <div class="prose prose-slate prose-blue max-w-none">
            <p class="lead text-xl text-slate-600 mb-8">
                Please read these terms carefully before using Air Sports Live Tracking.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
            <p>By accessing and using Air Sports Live Tracking (ASLT), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and all applicable laws and regulations.</p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4">2. Use of Service</h2>
            <p>ASLT provides a platform for live tracking and scoring of aircraft competitions. You agree to use the service only for lawful purposes and in a way that does not infringe the rights of others.</p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4">3. Data Accuracy</h2>
            <p>While we strive for high precision in our automated scoring engine, tracking data depends on GPS accuracy and mobile network availability. ASLT is not responsible for scoring discrepancies caused by hardware or network failures.</p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4">4. Safety First</h2>
            <p><strong>Tracking is NOT a substitute for primary navigation or safety equipment.</strong> Pilots remain solely responsible for the safe operation of their aircraft at all times. Do not allow the use of this application to distract you from safe flying practices.</p>

            <div class="mt-20 p-8 bg-slate-100 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200">
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: April 2024</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
